  "Every obsolete source records a reason rather than disappearing from the migration inventory."
  "Source blobs remain byte-identical to the pinned Foundation source wherever no portability adaptation is required."
  "The deterministic and lifecycle slices pass through JavaScript, Lua, and Python Tahto runtimes."
  "The in-memory transport preserves the Foundation text-wire and linked-node behavior."
  "The target-emitted runtime remains independent from host-side std.substrate implementation objects."]}
